# Order matters: a later pattern overrides an earlier one, so every exclusion
# comes after any re-inclusion and nothing here re-includes a build output.

# Local state and build outputs, none of which the image build reads.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/artifacts
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/TestResults

# Not needed to build the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
tests
scripts
third_party

# The tray shell targets net10.0-windows and is not part of this image.
src/Clash.Desktop

# Only the root markdown is excluded; no directory above is excluded wholesale,
# so nothing under web/ or docker/ is affected.
*.md
